{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-26","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：角与线段","englishTitle":"On a given straight line, and at a given point on it, to construct a solid angle equal to a given solid angle.","book":11,"number":26,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.26","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.26/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":26,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","contentId":"euclid-11-26","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbb6a0450058d336c675999072c08d9750567b9aeca609f3c36833e3b2774a75","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-26.statement","euclid-11-26.construction.1","euclid-11-26.construction.2","euclid-11-26.construction.3","euclid-11-26.proof.1","euclid-11-26.proof.2","euclid-11-26.proof.3","euclid-11-26.proof.4","euclid-11-26.proof.5","euclid-11-26.proof.6","euclid-11-26.proof.7","euclid-11-26.proof.8","euclid-11-26.proof.9","euclid-11-26.conclusion","euclid-11-26.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-26.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b818e5bb968cd2894f93b3832f435288d0154f3a8e220958e2fcb5c2d76d1bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"On a given straight line, and at a given point on it, to construct a solid angle equal to a given solid angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在给定的直线上,并在给定的点上,构建一个等于给定的立体角的立体角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f5153fc009c163504a2d7f9ba108c480b5a273e501f40b45c3f933805f88685","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given straight line, A the given point on it, and the angle at D, contained by the angles EDC, EDF, FDC, the given solid angle; thus it is required to construct on the straight line AB, and at the point A on it, a solid angle equal to the solid angle at D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB线为给定直线,A准点为D,角为D,角为EDC,EDF,FDC,角为给定的立体角;因此,必须在AB线上和A点上建造一个等于D线的立体角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e98bdabe9956c170e901f9d15adc0856530c6dc736459c48d6b1e3c86d451dfa","citations":["euclid-11-11","euclid-1-23","euclid-11-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let a point F be taken at random on DF, let FG be drawn from F perpendicular to the plane through ED, DC, and let it meet the plane at G, [[XI. 11](/principles/euclid-11-11)] let DG be joined, let there be constructed on the straight line AB and at the point A on it the angle BAL equal to the angle EDC, and the angle BAK equal to the angle EDG, [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] let AK be made equal to DG, let KH be set up from the point K at right angles to the plane through BA, AL, [[XI. 12](/principles/euclid-11-12)] let KH be made equal to GF, and let HA be joined; I say that the solid angle at A, contained by the angles BAL, BAH, HAL is equal to the solid angle at D contained by the angles EDC, EDF, FDC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"随机选取F点,DF点,DC点,F点,平面点到ED点,DC点, DG点连接,AB点直线,AB点上方BAL点等于EDC点,BAK点等于EDG点,AK点等于DG点,直角点到平面点到BA点,AL点上方KH点上方K点让KH等于GF,让HA连接起来;我说,A的立体角由BAL、BAH、HAL角组成,等于EDC、EDF、FDC角组成的立体角。（相关点与线段：FG） [[XI. 11](/principles/euclid-11-11)] [[I. 23](/principles/euclid-1-23)] [[XI. 12](/principles/euclid-11-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02381c21f60da8fc552de84297e329eb9bb596a36f1b21bd72cb86bfbdf47772","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AB, DE be cut off equal to one another, and let HB, KB, FE, GE be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,DE 被切断 等量,HB,KB,FE,GE连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ab875bd6e2a378613ee21d7468368837d1a0615d0f8d14288ce824fa1c0a5da","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since FG is at right angles to the plane of reference, it will also make right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane of reference; [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)] therefore each of the angles FGD, FGE is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于FG是直角,参考线平面,它也将使直角与所有横交的直线相交,并处于平面参考线之内;因此,每个角度FGD,FGE是正确的。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4839933badf77aeba5f97a6a557a32372dd6b4dc11d81e94be86fae3a4afd698","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the angles HKA, HKB is also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,每个角度HKA,HKB也是对的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0e03249821798571564e76eb51f6e056a4edf63bb5a3ea0d627c093fd829a9c9","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the two sides KA, AB are equal to the two sides GD, DE respectively, and they contain equal angles, therefore the base KB is equal to the base GE. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于双方KA,AB分别等于双方GD,DE,而且它们包含同等角度,因此底边,KB等于底边,GE。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba808145151295ded8d0d35a17d10b01307f141540b0bb0bdcad5d63b2fd98d5","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But KH is also equal to GF, and they contain right angles; therefore HB is also equal to FE. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KH也等于GF,其中含有直角;因此,HB也等于FE。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"973edd6c4029e4d262b4b355589c9853154b31ce7109d6838533c7a7f88596c2","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the two sides AK, KH are equal to the two sides DG, GF, and they contain right angles, therefore the base AH is equal to the base FD. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于双方AK、KH和DG等值,而且双方共有直角个,因此,底边 AH等于底边 FD。（相关点与线段：GF） [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7627ad1fb40a600720cf9ea4121c4ddc09483d18b6d3e658af9049cd8d717c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is also equal to DE; therefore the two sides HA, AB are equal to the two sides DF, DE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB也等于DE;因此,双方HA,AB,即双方DF,DE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"334359711850841ed4a24d2457b28a411d50b48bf389324bdd753be61aac19f4","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the base HB is equal to the base FE; therefore the angle BAH is equal to the angle EDF. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"底边 HB等于底边 FE,因此角度BAH等于角度EDF。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"da2832fe4786df1deed2ad0148c8828adbca993f126fef353a9e21e243081a5d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angle HAL is also equal to the angle FDC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,HAL角也等于FDC角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bb659516f59c73d0ad1cda4f7ee07850cc62431cd02963d65c0e73763bf04c5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the angle BAL is also equal to the angle EDC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"角度BAL也等于角度EDC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0af707140e2873533cc303afb515f6cd8a5ab31c9ce35bbe1f79b98c7717b5f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore on the straight line AB, and at the point A on it, a solid angle has been constructed equal to the given solid angle at D. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在AB线上,在A点上,已建造一个立体角,等于D、Q、E、F的定立体角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-26.source","contentId":"euclid-11-26","revisionId":"euclid-11-26@raw-dbb6a0450058d336","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8088cdb20ed4535815e5d165748751e8746c7b172b28ced155cec3382269e23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","lang